{"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/HNSWIndex","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorMetric","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorSearchResult"],"title":"Spatial Indexing","anchor":"Spatial-Indexing"}],"metadata":{"role":"collectionGroup","modules":[{"name":"SwiftCluster"}],"title":"High-Dimensional Vector Search with HNSW","roleHeading":"API Collection"},"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/DimensionalityReduction","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/ClusteringAndOutliers","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorStoreAndRAG"],"title":"Guides & Tutorials","anchor":"Guides--Tutorials","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When vector collections expand beyond tens of thousands of items, exact (O(N)) linear scans become a major latency bottleneck for real-time recommendation and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) systems."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HNSWIndex"},{"type":"text","text":" actor provides a hierarchical graph-based spatial partitioning index with sub-millisecond query latency and logarithmic (O(\\log N)) search scaling."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Hierarchical-Navigable-Small-World-Architecture","text":"Hierarchical Navigable Small World Architecture","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"HNSW constructs a hierarchy of graph layers:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Top Layers (Sparse)","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Contain widely spaced long-range highway edges for rapid coarse geometric routing across distant clusters."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Intermediate Layers","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Progressively decrease edge length while increasing vertex density."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Bottom Layer (Layer 0, Dense)","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Contains all indexed vertices connected by dense short-range edges for high-accuracy localized nearest-neighbor refinement."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["Layer 2 (Express):   [A] ───────────────────────────► [F]","                      │                                │","                      ▼                                ▼","Layer 1 (Regional):  [A] ──────────► [C] ────────────► [F]","                      │               │                │","                      ▼               ▼                ▼","Layer 0 (Base):      [A] ──► [B] ──► [C] ──► [D] ──► [E] ──► [F]"],"syntax":null},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Key-Configuration-Parameters","text":"Key Configuration Parameters","level":2},{"type":"table","header":"row","alignments":["left","left","left"],"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Parameter","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Recommended Default","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Impact on Search Quality & Index Build Time","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"M"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"16"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Maximum outgoing connections per node. Higher values improve recall at the cost of higher memory and index construction time.","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"efConstruction"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"200"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Size of dynamic candidate evaluation queue during insertion. Larger values produce higher-quality graph connectivity.","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"efSearch"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"50"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Dynamic queue size during search traversal. Higher values increase search recall towards 100% exact match.","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"metric"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".euclideanDistance"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Choice of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".euclideanDistance"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".cosineSimilarity"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".dotProduct"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]]]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Example-Usage","text":"Example Usage","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiftCluster","","\/\/ 1. Initialize the actor-isolated index","let hnsw = HNSWIndex(metric: .cosineSimilarity, M: 16, efConstruction: 200, efSearch: 50)","","\/\/ 2. Add embeddings asynchronously","await hnsw.add(id: \"doc_news_1\", vector: [0.12, 0.94, -0.31], metadata: [\"category\": \"news\"])","await hnsw.add(id: \"doc_tech_2\", vector: [-0.85, 0.11, 0.52], metadata: [\"category\": \"technology\"])","","\/\/ 3. Query Top-K nearest neighbors","let queryEmbedding = [0.10, 0.90, -0.30]","let matches = await hnsw.search(query: queryEmbedding, topK: 5)","","for match in matches {","    print(\"Matched: \\(match.id) with score: \\(match.score)\")","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Thread-Safety--Swift-6-Strict-Concurrency","text":"Thread Safety & Swift 6 Strict Concurrency","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HNSWIndex"},{"type":"text","text":" is implemented as an isolated Swift "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actor"},{"type":"text","text":", guaranteeing thread safety and eliminating race conditions when multiple background tasks insert items or execute queries concurrently."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/hnswvectorsearch"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/HNSWVectorSearch","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Scale approximate nearest neighbor (ANN) retrieval logarithmically using Hierarchical Navigable Small World graphs."}],"references":{"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster/DimensionalityReduction":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reduce feature dimensionality using SVD-based PCA with automatic CPU and UMA GPU routing."}],"role":"article","kind":"article","title":"Principal Component Analysis (PCA)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/DimensionalityReduction","url":"\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/dimensionalityreduction"},"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster/VectorMetric":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorMetric","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/vectormetric","title":"VectorMetric","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VectorMetric","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"VectorMetric","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Distance or similarity metrics supported by ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorStore"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster/VectorStore":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic",